      "fr": "RDC : La riposte juridique de Joseph Kabila face aux sanctions américaines, un test pour la diplomatie et la justice",
      "en": "DRC: Joseph Kabila's Legal Counter-Offensive Against US Sanctions, A Test for Diplomacy and Justice"
